    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Corsair Coterie",
    "summary": "Whenever an **ANHRATHE** unit joins your army, it can take a single Corsair Enhancement. Your army cannot include the same Corsair Enhancement more than once. A unit's points cost goes up by its Enhancement's cost, as the Munitorum Field Manual lists it, and if that puts your army over the battle's [points limit](vsdata:core-rule/fill-your-army-roster), the unit cannot be included.",
